class = "interface-mismatch"
severity = "high"
observed = "The embedded provider forwards transactions without checking tx.from and replaces any supplied tx.chainId with configured chain125; personal_sign and eth_sign also discard the requested account. The gateway signs as the bearer session's wallet, so a request naming another account or chain can authorize a different signer/network rather than reject. sdk/wallet/src/provider.ts explicitly checks these fields."
